      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Who takes damage when two heroes have the same hp and the card indicated that they take damage? \"x person with the highest health takes two\" if two people have the same health then who takes the dmg?\n\nWhen fighting omnitron, does he have a total of 100 HP? Or should I keep a running total of both his forms hp and decided the battle is over when the first one hits zero?\n\nIf a hero is defeated do his ongoing cards, equipment and etc. leave the field? \n\nWhen a hero is flipped how do his other abilities work?\n\nThanks for your time! I might come up with more questions..",
