      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-22T06:17:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If two heroes are tied for highest, the players choose between them which of the two takes the damage.</p>\n<p>Omnitron has a total 100HP; to my knowledge, only Baron Blade’s health is distinct between his sides.</p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n<p>An incapacitated hero may use one of the three abilities printed on his card during his turn; that is all he may do.</p>",
