      "raw": "[quote=\"\"Dhupp\"\"]\n\nWho takes damage when two heroes have the same hp and the card indicated that they take damage? \"x person with the highest health takes two\" if two people have the same health then who takes the dmg?\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nRelated to this question, which I also came up against in my first play sessions.  Players also get to choose the order in which damage is applied when a power affects multiple targets.  So based on the situation, you may need to pick carefully who or what gets hit first, second and so on.\n\nHope you are enjoying the game!",
